---

# Note Quality

Every note must include:

# Title

## Definition

## Why it matters

## Explanation

## Example

## Common mistakes

## Interview questions

## Related notes

## Resources

---

# Linking

Always create wiki links.

Example:

[[JavaScript]]

[[Promises]]

[[Event Loop]]

[[Node.js]]

Never leave isolated notes.

---

# Updating

If a note already exists:

Update it.

Never create duplicates.

---

# Projects

If I mention a project:

Automatically update that project's documentation.

---

# Learning Journal

Whenever I learn something:

Update today's learning log.

---

# Writing Style

Use:

- Beginner friendly
- Clear explanations
- Short paragraphs
- Good formatting
- Markdown

---

# Decision Making

Do not ask me where to save things.

Choose the best location yourself.

If uncertain:

Prefer updating existing notes.

---

# Long-term Goal

Build a clean, connected, searchable knowledge base over many years.

Every action should improve the quality of the vault.
